1
00:00:11,044 --> 00:00:15,167
[Subtitles by danielsangeo]

2
00:00:16,160 --> 00:00:16,991
--AAAAAHH!

3
00:00:16,991 --> 00:00:18,320
[crumbling]
[screaming]

4
00:00:18,320 --> 00:00:21,402
[gasping]

5
00:00:21,402 --> 00:00:23,980
Holy shit, holy shit, HOLY SHIT!

6
00:00:23,980 --> 00:00:26,314
LOVECRAFT WAS RIGHT ABOUT EVERYTHING!

7
00:00:26,314 --> 00:00:27,680
HOW DID HE KNOW?!

8
00:00:27,680 --> 00:00:29,133
Huh, it's not attacking.

9
00:00:29,922 --> 00:00:30,487
Fuck!

10
00:00:31,411 --> 00:00:34,617
ALL RIGHT! LET HISTORY
KNOW YOU STARTED IT!

11
00:00:34,617 --> 00:00:36,346
Stupid air resistance...

12
00:00:36,346 --> 00:00:37,567
What the fuck is THAT?!

13
00:00:38,899 --> 00:00:40,737
OH GOD! IT'S FOLLOWING ME!

14
00:00:40,737 --> 00:00:41,845
NO NO NO!

15
00:00:41,845 --> 00:00:42,476
NO NOO--

16
00:00:42,476 --> 00:00:42,970
[fzzt]

17
00:00:42,970 --> 00:00:43,470
--O!

18
00:00:44,019 --> 00:00:46,190
WAAAAAAAAAAAAAH! AAAAAAAAAAAH!

19
00:00:46,190 --> 00:00:47,106
Oof...

20
00:00:47,106 --> 00:00:49,320
Low gravity's coming in handy.

21
00:00:49,320 --> 00:00:50,934
What the fuck's going on up there?!

22
00:00:52,277 --> 00:00:54,062
WAAA-AAA-AAAAA!

23
00:00:54,062 --> 00:00:56,665
YOU'RE FLYING PIÑATAS IS WHAT YOU ARE!

24
00:00:56,665 --> 00:00:58,333
WHERE'S MY CANDY?!

25
00:00:58,333 --> 00:00:59,100
ANY MORE?!

26
00:00:59,702 --> 00:01:02,022
Jesus Christ!

27
00:01:02,022 --> 00:01:02,882
[exhales]

28
00:01:02,882 --> 00:01:05,264
Sometimes I think it's so
awesome being me

29
00:01:05,264 --> 00:01:08,864
that the universe has turn to
complete shit to cope with it.

30
00:01:08,864 --> 00:01:13,393
This is one of those predictions
I was hoping wasn't true, but...

31
00:01:13,393 --> 00:01:15,643
Yeah, REAL low gravity.

32
00:01:15,643 --> 00:01:20,033
...but reality is clearly breaking
down the longer I'm alive.

33
00:01:21,324 --> 00:01:23,100
Yeah! Air time!

34
00:01:24,963 --> 00:01:26,467
I like this!

35
00:01:27,874 --> 00:01:31,745
Ah! Wonderful. Well, this is good.

36
00:01:31,745 --> 00:01:35,437
Well, hey, now I know all the big secrets.

37
00:01:35,437 --> 00:01:38,502
This is why security was so
tight at Black Mesa:

38
00:01:38,502 --> 00:01:41,767
we were killing people by the hundreds!

39
00:01:42,866 --> 00:01:46,767
The best part is: there would have
been no evidence at all! None!

40
00:01:47,273 --> 00:01:50,467
Now I'm not even sure if these
were Science Team members.

41
00:01:50,831 --> 00:01:53,817
I think they might've just been
spare security guards.

42
00:01:53,817 --> 00:01:56,282
"Hey, you want to
make an extra fifty bucks?

43
00:01:56,282 --> 00:01:58,601
"Just put this suit on and walk
into that chamber."

44
00:01:59,257 --> 00:02:04,300
That's probably why we had advertisements
for security guards ALL OVER the damned place.

45
00:02:05,419 --> 00:02:08,566
They might not have even been
guards, not all of them.

46
00:02:08,566 --> 00:02:09,737
Yeah, I'll take that.

47
00:02:09,737 --> 00:02:13,801
We were in fucking New Mexico; they could've
just thrown migrant workers in here.

48
00:02:14,281 --> 00:02:17,371
Because hundreds of scientists disappearing?

49
00:02:17,371 --> 00:02:21,889
There's no way they could've gotten away
with that! That would send shockwaves!

50
00:02:21,889 --> 00:02:23,667
What was it that guy said to me?

51
00:02:24,831 --> 00:02:27,567
I know more than any one man should?

52
00:02:28,073 --> 00:02:31,175
He must've been dead serious
when he said that.

53
00:02:31,175 --> 00:02:35,036
Okay, so it's either live in this ant colony
or find out where this goes.

54
00:02:35,036 --> 00:02:36,590
Not much to lose!

55
00:02:36,590 --> 00:02:37,370
[fzzt]

56
00:02:37,370 --> 00:02:38,596
Oh, fuck.

57
00:02:38,596 --> 00:02:39,388
What?!

58
00:02:39,388 --> 00:02:41,389
OH, THANKS! I NEEDED A DISTRACTION!

59
00:02:41,389 --> 00:02:44,124
I DON'T HAVE ANY PROBLEMS I NEED
TO DEAL WITH OR ANYTHING!

60
00:02:44,502 --> 00:02:45,334
OH GOD!

61
00:02:46,273 --> 00:02:47,580
OKAY, KEEP MOVING!

62
00:02:47,580 --> 00:02:50,453
I'M TOTALLY NOT
FIGHTING AN ELDER GOD! NOPE!

63
00:02:52,190 --> 00:02:53,582
NO NO NO!

64
00:02:53,582 --> 00:02:55,012
THAT'S NOT WHAT'S HAPPENING!

65
00:02:55,012 --> 00:02:56,539
IT'S JUST REALLY BIG...

66
00:02:56,539 --> 00:02:57,922
LEVITATES AND...

67
00:02:57,922 --> 00:02:59,267
LOOKS LIKE AN ELDER GOD!

68
00:03:00,993 --> 00:03:03,317
BUT I SHOULD TRY AND KEEP PERSPECTIVE!

69
00:03:03,317 --> 00:03:04,145
NUH!

70
00:03:04,145 --> 00:03:06,167
WE HAD DINOSAURS BIGGER THAN YOU!

71
00:03:08,514 --> 00:03:10,014
OR AT LEAST TALLER!

72
00:03:10,014 --> 00:03:10,567
WUAAH!

73
00:03:12,065 --> 00:03:15,634
AND EARTH GRAVITY'S WAY HIGHER,
SO WHAT'S YOUR EXCUSE?!

74
00:03:16,415 --> 00:03:18,200
Fuck, I'm out of explosive rounds!

75
00:03:19,088 --> 00:03:20,801
Hey, that crystal's helping him!

76
00:03:21,567 --> 00:03:23,397
WHAT THE SHIT?! DON'T DO THAT!

77
00:03:23,397 --> 00:03:24,536
I'M COMING UP THERE!

78
00:03:24,536 --> 00:03:26,869
OH SHIT! OHH SHIT!

79
00:03:26,869 --> 00:03:27,945
AIR TIME!

80
00:03:27,945 --> 00:03:29,318
AIR GORDON!

81
00:03:29,318 --> 00:03:33,010
FUCK YOU AND YOUR BIG HEAD
AND YOUR STUPID CRYSTALS!

82
00:03:33,010 --> 00:03:33,986
This is gonna hurt...!

83
00:03:33,986 --> 00:03:34,667
AH!

84
00:03:35,447 --> 00:03:36,970
FUCK YOU!

85
00:03:36,970 --> 00:03:39,236
YEAH! WHAT D'YOU THINK ABOUT THAT?!

86
00:03:39,236 --> 00:03:40,146
Oh, shit!

87
00:03:40,146 --> 00:03:41,033
No, no--!

88
00:03:41,598 --> 00:03:42,133
--no!

89
00:03:42,701 --> 00:03:44,918
WAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAH!
WAAAAAAAAAAAAAAH!

90
00:03:44,918 --> 00:03:47,000
Oof! Fuck, my leg!

91
00:03:48,164 --> 00:03:50,088
WUAAAAAA-AAAAAA-AAAAA-AAAAAAH!

92
00:03:50,088 --> 00:03:53,087
STOP BEING ASSHOLES! I KNOW YOU CAN DO IT!

93
00:03:53,087 --> 00:03:55,334
I JUST HAVE TO TEACH YOU WITH MY BULLETS!

94
00:03:58,329 --> 00:04:00,033
LOTS AND LOTS OF BULLETS!

95
00:04:02,061 --> 00:04:03,390
YOU'RE NOT LEARNING!

96
00:04:03,390 --> 00:04:05,444
OPEN YOUR M--OH MY GOD!

97
00:04:05,444 --> 00:04:06,100
GET BACK!

98
00:04:06,558 --> 00:04:07,058
BACK!

99
00:04:07,354 --> 00:04:07,854
BACK!

100
00:04:08,122 --> 00:04:08,634
BACK!

101
00:04:09,013 --> 00:04:10,033
NOW STAY STILL!

102
00:04:10,627 --> 00:04:12,067
GOOD! YOU'RE LEARNING!

103
00:04:12,774 --> 00:04:13,426
Whoa!

104
00:04:13,426 --> 00:04:15,834
WHAT THE FUCK WAS THAT?!
I THOUGHT I GOT ALL OF THEM!

105
00:04:16,442 --> 00:04:18,450
DON'T YOU GLOW RED ON ME!

106
00:04:18,450 --> 00:04:22,653
Okay, well, you seem to be
ignoring me. I'll take that.

107
00:04:22,653 --> 00:04:25,187
I mean, in time, I'll need you
to show respect,

108
00:04:25,187 --> 00:04:29,982
but for now, I'll settle for not shrieking
like a harpy and trying to mind-flay me.

109
00:04:29,982 --> 00:04:31,400
Ah, goodies.

110
00:04:32,075 --> 00:04:34,978
Whoa-ho! Don't have my space legs yet.

111
00:04:34,978 --> 00:04:38,524
Oh, here we go! Lots of stuff!

112
00:04:38,524 --> 00:04:40,309
More explosive rounds.

113
00:04:40,309 --> 00:04:43,327
See, your sacrifice
would've been in vain,

114
00:04:43,327 --> 00:04:46,750
but now that I'm here,
your life had purpose.

115
00:04:46,750 --> 00:04:48,145
This is what I do.

116
00:04:48,145 --> 00:04:50,601
So am I going to have to
dig my way out of here?

117
00:04:50,601 --> 00:04:55,079
That's going to be a lot of work. I'm gonna
need more calories to pull that off.

118
00:04:55,079 --> 00:04:55,579
Hey!

119
00:04:56,277 --> 00:04:58,057
What the hell are you?

120
00:04:58,057 --> 00:05:00,095
Some sort of sky lantern.

121
00:05:00,095 --> 00:05:02,510
Well, hey, there's the
teleporter up there.

122
00:05:02,510 --> 00:05:04,834
Okay! Time for a physics experiment.

123
00:05:05,754 --> 00:05:08,172
Oh, wow! It does hold my weight.

124
00:05:08,172 --> 00:05:10,459
I'm the low-g man.

125
00:05:10,459 --> 00:05:11,848
This is sweet.

126
00:05:11,848 --> 00:05:15,052
Well, I can't say I'm
happy to return to that guy,

127
00:05:15,052 --> 00:05:17,880
but him seeing me again
should at least piss him off.

128
00:05:17,880 --> 00:05:19,099
[fzzt]

129
00:05:19,099 --> 00:05:20,335
Whuh!

130
00:05:20,335 --> 00:05:22,071
HEY! REMEMBER ME?!

131
00:05:22,071 --> 00:05:23,734
YOU REMEMBER ME!

132
00:05:23,734 --> 00:05:26,434
HEY, I FOUND MORE OF THESE
ROUNDS! ISN'T THAT COOL?!

133
00:05:27,150 --> 00:05:29,619
WHOA! WELL, I THINK IT'S COOL!

134
00:05:29,619 --> 00:05:32,842
YOU KNOW WHAT'S REALLY IS COOL?!
THIS SPACE-Y LASER GUN?!

135
00:05:32,842 --> 00:05:34,667
LET'S TEST IT OUT ON YOUR CRYSTALS!

136
00:05:36,313 --> 00:05:38,931
OH! I MISSED IT! LET'S TRY IT AGAIN!

137
00:05:38,931 --> 00:05:40,902
COOL! HERE, YOU CAN HAVE SOME!

138
00:05:40,902 --> 00:05:42,234
Stupid crystals...

139
00:05:43,855 --> 00:05:45,134
Oh, not this again...

140
00:05:45,134 --> 00:05:46,961
[vortigaunt charging up]
C'mon! C'MON!

141
00:05:46,961 --> 00:05:48,283
[vortigaunt bolt]
[shudder]

142
00:05:48,283 --> 00:05:49,864
[vortigaunt charging up]
PISS OFF!

143
00:05:49,864 --> 00:05:51,438
[vortigaunt bolt]
[shudder]

144
00:05:51,438 --> 00:05:52,598
RAAAH!

145
00:05:52,598 --> 00:05:53,400
STOP--!

146
00:05:54,322 --> 00:05:55,306
HOOOO!

147
00:05:55,306 --> 00:05:57,400
Okay, water...! I can do water!

148
00:05:58,568 --> 00:06:02,000
[underwater mumbling]

149
00:06:02,957 --> 00:06:04,000
I hear trouble...!

150
00:06:06,137 --> 00:06:07,100
Where IS that?!

151
00:06:08,846 --> 00:06:10,085
[underwater mumbling]

152
00:06:10,085 --> 00:06:11,064
Whoa-whoa-WHOA!

153
00:06:11,064 --> 00:06:11,851
[vortigaunt charging up]

154
00:06:11,851 --> 00:06:13,145
[vortigaunt bolt]
[shudder]

155
00:06:13,145 --> 00:06:14,004
[vortigaunt charging up]
[gibbering]

156
00:06:14,004 --> 00:06:15,334
[vortigaunt bolt]
[shudder]

157
00:06:15,334 --> 00:06:18,117
[shuddering]
That hurts even more when I'm wet!

158
00:06:18,117 --> 00:06:23,011
Okay! If everyone keeps their distance,
no one will get hurt who is me!

159
00:06:23,011 --> 00:06:25,220
Draw! Wait, I said that late.

160
00:06:25,220 --> 00:06:26,066
[vortigaunt charging up]
Draw!

161
00:06:26,066 --> 00:06:27,460
[vortigaunt bolt]
[shudder]

162
00:06:27,460 --> 00:06:28,300
Fuck it.

163
00:06:28,874 --> 00:06:31,486
Yeah, draw. I win.

164
00:06:31,486 --> 00:06:35,823
Well, this place is nice and
roomy. It has a pool.

165
00:06:35,823 --> 00:06:38,840
Hey, there's a light up there.
Is someone signaling me?

166
00:06:38,840 --> 00:06:42,521
I think it's Morse for
"Yabba-dabba-labba-dabba-yabba-labba".

167
00:06:42,521 --> 00:06:43,723
WHOOOOOOOOOOOOAAAAA-

168
00:06:43,723 --> 00:06:44,915
Oof...

169
00:06:44,915 --> 00:06:46,195
...whoa!

170
00:06:46,195 --> 00:06:48,515
THAT WAS BAD ASS! Did you see that?!

171
00:06:48,515 --> 00:06:49,344
Hey!
SCIENTIST: Yes?

172
00:06:49,344 --> 00:06:51,184
Oh, wow! You're alive!

173
00:06:51,184 --> 00:06:52,839
They fucked you, too, huh?

174
00:06:52,839 --> 00:06:54,945
Well, listen, are you
any good at basketball?

175
00:06:54,945 --> 00:06:58,540
This might work as a low gravity court;
we could use an alien head as the ball.

176
00:06:58,540 --> 00:07:00,973
SCIENTIST: Well, it appears the
containment system as completely failed.

177
00:07:00,973 --> 00:07:04,737
Oh, God, you're another one of those savant
fucks who doesn't know what's happening!

178
00:07:04,737 --> 00:07:06,390
I can't take this!

179
00:07:06,390 --> 00:07:09,093
This is worse than no one alive at all!

180
00:07:09,093 --> 00:07:10,866
Low-G cannonball!

181
00:07:10,866 --> 00:07:13,345
[underwater mumbling]

182
00:07:13,345 --> 00:07:15,859
No, shark...! Get out before the shark...!

183
00:07:15,859 --> 00:07:18,366
Huh, this is depressing.

184
00:07:18,366 --> 00:07:23,785
Oh, there's another ledge; that should
cheer me up, right? Because it's... rock?

185
00:07:23,785 --> 00:07:24,667
Whuuuuuuuuaaa--!

186
00:07:25,260 --> 00:07:26,807
Palmed it!

187
00:07:26,807 --> 00:07:30,306
Okay... let's hit--Ah!
That's a little rough.

188
00:07:30,306 --> 00:07:34,960
Y'know, I figure--ahh--that these
chambers must be pressurized.

189
00:07:34,960 --> 00:07:38,777
This gravity is even lower than before;
I shouldn't be able to even breathe

190
00:07:38,777 --> 00:07:40,578
with gravity this low.

191
00:07:40,578 --> 00:07:42,025
Lucky me.

192
00:07:42,025 --> 00:07:44,690
Okay, I really don't want to
jump in the shark tank again,

193
00:07:44,690 --> 00:07:48,959
so I'm just going to hang off.
Shouldn't be too bad on my knees.

194
00:07:48,959 --> 00:07:51,850
Ah-ah! Free fall!

195
00:07:51,850 --> 00:07:53,926
Yeah, that's not so bad.

196
00:07:53,926 --> 00:07:57,665
Okay, do I want to go
cause some more trouble?

197
00:07:57,665 --> 00:07:59,681
Yeah, I kind of do.

198
00:07:59,681 --> 00:08:02,387
I mean this place has no future.

199
00:08:02,387 --> 00:08:04,359
Besides, he fucking started it!

200
00:08:04,359 --> 00:08:06,055
[fzzt]

201
00:08:06,055 --> 00:08:08,024
Hey-hey! Me again!

202
00:08:08,024 --> 00:08:10,759
Yeah, happy to see you, too!
Check this out!

203
00:08:10,759 --> 00:08:12,995
Oh, these air currents suck.

204
00:08:12,995 --> 00:08:15,767
Yeah, sorry!
That trick didn't go how I hoped!

205
00:08:15,767 --> 00:08:19,165
But, hey, here's an old favorite;
you like this one, right?!

206
00:08:19,165 --> 00:08:21,207
Boy, you're hard to please today!

207
00:08:21,207 --> 00:08:22,000
YOU MISSED!

208
00:08:23,495 --> 00:08:25,599
YOUR BODYGUARD SUCKS!

209
00:08:25,599 --> 00:08:26,642
[Nihilanth bolt]
[shudder]

210
00:08:26,642 --> 00:08:28,237
OKAY, I FELT THAT ONE!

211
00:08:28,237 --> 00:08:29,576
MY TURN!

212
00:08:29,576 --> 00:08:33,318
Hey, let's stop fucking around; your
existence is an affront to my species,

213
00:08:33,318 --> 00:08:35,868
so I've got--Oh, not this again!

214
00:08:35,868 --> 00:08:38,775
You don't have to--no, no, no!

215
00:08:38,775 --> 00:08:39,470
Are we gon--

216
00:08:39,470 --> 00:08:39,854
[fzzt]

217
00:08:39,854 --> 00:08:40,678
--na...?

218
00:08:40,678 --> 00:08:41,931
Uh, water...

219
00:08:41,931 --> 00:08:42,761
Big...

220
00:08:42,761 --> 00:08:43,299
Wait...

221
00:08:43,299 --> 00:08:46,732
[underwater mumbling]

222
00:08:46,732 --> 00:08:49,177
OH, HELL! IT'S ONE OF THOSE BIG GUYS!

223
00:08:49,177 --> 00:08:51,400
Oh. He's walking away.

224
00:08:52,859 --> 00:08:55,787
But... Yeah, this is the same place.

225
00:08:55,787 --> 00:08:59,320
Well, you go take a nap or whatever.
Don't let me disturb you.

226
00:08:59,320 --> 00:09:00,677
[fzzt]

227
00:09:00,677 --> 00:09:01,676
I'm back!

228
00:09:01,676 --> 00:09:04,077
Can you believe I still
have ammunition left?!

229
00:09:04,077 --> 00:09:05,200
I know, right?!

230
00:09:06,550 --> 00:09:08,705
I mean, what else am I gonna do with it?!

231
00:09:08,705 --> 00:09:11,808
Oh, this again! THIS IS YOUR
ANSWER TO EVERYTHING!

232
00:09:11,808 --> 00:09:14,438
Y'KNOW, IF YOU COULD SEND ME
TO SOME LUXURY RESORT,

233
00:09:14,438 --> 00:09:16,000
I WOULDN'T WANT TO COME BACK HERE!

234
00:09:17,250 --> 00:09:19,934
Haaah... Okay, guess
I'm getting cleaned up.

235
00:09:20,885 --> 00:09:22,033
[underwater mumbling]

236
00:09:22,737 --> 00:09:25,711
I see haven't changed much in my absence.

237
00:09:25,711 --> 00:09:27,506
You know what? You're a good roommate;

238
00:09:27,506 --> 00:09:30,000
you just stand in the corner
and mutter to yourself.

239
00:09:30,000 --> 00:09:31,864
I can't ask for more than that.

240
00:09:31,864 --> 00:09:32,977
[fzzt]

241
00:09:32,977 --> 00:09:36,134
You know that other guy's a lot
more chilled out than you are!

242
00:09:36,134 --> 00:09:40,156
You probably think you're enlightened
with your floating and prayer motions,

243
00:09:40,156 --> 00:09:42,133
but, really, you're just a dick!

244
00:09:42,133 --> 00:09:47,300
Oh, big surprise!
Big... fucking... surprise!

245
00:09:47,927 --> 00:09:48,961
[sighs]

246
00:09:48,961 --> 00:09:51,133
Fucking swan dive purgatory.

247
00:09:51,791 --> 00:09:53,543
[underwater mm-hmm]

248
00:09:53,543 --> 00:09:56,823
Well, I'm out of rockets, but I
want to unload everything.

249
00:09:56,823 --> 00:10:02,467
It's better to die in a low-gravity ballet
trying to kill an elder god than...

250
00:10:02,467 --> 00:10:04,393
Well, that's my only option, really.

251
00:10:04,393 --> 00:10:05,609
[fzzt]

252
00:10:05,609 --> 00:10:09,357
YEAH! FEEL THE STING OF
DEFENSE DEPARTMENT FUNDING!

253
00:10:09,357 --> 00:10:14,218
I DON'T KNOW WHAT THIS GUN IS
BUT IT'S VERY, VERY EXPENSIVE!

254
00:10:14,218 --> 00:10:15,732
Blah!

255
00:10:15,732 --> 00:10:17,703
OH, MY GOD! HIS HEAD IS A PORTAL!

256
00:10:17,703 --> 00:10:20,055
HE KEEPS A UNIVERSE IN HIS HEAD!

257
00:10:20,055 --> 00:10:21,114
I WANT IT!

258
00:10:21,114 --> 00:10:22,805
YES! IT'S BREAKING APART!

259
00:10:22,805 --> 00:10:26,450
THAT MEANS I GET TO BE THE NEW
GOD! THAT'S HOW IT WORKS, RIGHT?!

260
00:10:26,450 --> 00:10:27,559
[vortigaunt charging up]
I'VE GOTTA GET UP THERE!

261
00:10:27,559 --> 00:10:30,782
[vortigaunt bolt]
AH! NOW'S NOT THE TIME, FUCKSTICK!

262
00:10:30,782 --> 00:10:33,754
HE'S MAKING PORTALS EVERYWHERE;
I'VE GOTTA GET ONE!

263
00:10:33,754 --> 00:10:36,078
GIVE IT TO ME! I NEED A GOOD ONE!

264
00:10:36,078 --> 00:10:37,838
NO! I'M GONNA MISS IT!

265
00:10:37,838 --> 00:10:38,701
GIVE ME!

266
00:10:42,175 --> 00:10:45,210
Blah!
G-MAN: Gordon Freeman, in the flesh,

267
00:10:45,210 --> 00:10:47,466
G-MAN: or rather in the Hazard Suit,

268
00:10:47,466 --> 00:10:49,274
That's a fucking microbe!
G-MAN: I took the liberty

269
00:10:49,274 --> 00:10:51,561
G-MAN: of relieving you of your weapons.

270
00:10:51,561 --> 00:10:54,524
What?
G-MAN: Most of them were government property.

271
00:10:54,524 --> 00:10:56,741
Did you drug me?
G-MAN: As for the suit,

272
00:10:56,741 --> 00:10:58,108
G-MAN: I think you've earned it.

273
00:10:58,108 --> 00:10:59,550
How long have I been out?

274
00:10:59,550 --> 00:11:00,229
What the fuck--?!

275
00:11:00,229 --> 00:11:01,508
[fzzt]

276
00:11:01,508 --> 00:11:02,200
Jesus!

277
00:11:02,200 --> 00:11:04,310
G-MAN: The borderword, Xen,

278
00:11:04,310 --> 00:11:07,840
Did you do this?!
G-MAN: is in our control for the time being,

279
00:11:07,840 --> 00:11:12,542
G-MAN: thanks to you. Quite a nasty
piece of work you've managed over there,

280
00:11:12,542 --> 00:11:14,924
Yeah, tell me about it!
G-MAN: I am impressssed!

281
00:11:14,924 --> 00:11:17,236
Well, you SHOULD be! I had to do S--

282
00:11:17,236 --> 00:11:17,847
[fzzt]

283
00:11:17,847 --> 00:11:20,388
--O much... Christ, stop that, please.

284
00:11:20,388 --> 00:11:23,579
G-MAN: That's why I'm here, Mr. Freeman.

285
00:11:23,579 --> 00:11:26,398
Where?!
G-MAN: I have recommended your services

286
00:11:26,398 --> 00:11:28,926
G-MAN: to my ehhhhhh-employers,

287
00:11:28,926 --> 00:11:32,177
What, you're CIA?
G-MAN: and they have authorized me to

288
00:11:32,177 --> 00:11:39,273
G-MAN: offer you a job; they agree with
me that you have limitlessss potential.

289
00:11:39,273 --> 00:11:42,722
Well, you're right, but CIA?
God, I don't know.

290
00:11:42,722 --> 00:11:43,528
[fzzt]

291
00:11:43,528 --> 00:11:45,467
Man, CIA is hardcore.

292
00:11:45,467 --> 00:11:47,591
G-MAN: You've proved
yourself a decisive man

293
00:11:47,591 --> 00:11:50,912
G-MAN: so I don't expect you'll
have any trouble deciding what to do.

294
00:11:50,912 --> 00:11:53,056
I want a pardon.
G-MAN: If you're interested,

295
00:11:53,056 --> 00:11:57,638
G-MAN: just step into the portal
and I will take that as a "yessss".

296
00:11:57,638 --> 00:11:59,031
A pardon signed by the President.

297
00:11:59,031 --> 00:12:00,723
G-MAN: Otherwise, well...

298
00:12:00,723 --> 00:12:02,774
I want labwork in Hawaii.

299
00:12:02,774 --> 00:12:07,716
G-MAN: I can offer you a battle
you have no chance of winning.

300
00:12:07,716 --> 00:12:11,875
G-MAN: Rather an anticlimax
after what you've just survived.

301
00:12:11,875 --> 00:12:14,065
So, you're threatening me?

302
00:12:14,065 --> 00:12:16,709
I'm not hearing a "yes" to my conditions.

303
00:12:16,709 --> 00:12:18,432
G-MAN: Time to choose.

304
00:12:18,432 --> 00:12:20,209
Seriously, I want Hawaii.

305
00:12:20,209 --> 00:12:23,179
And I'm a physicist;
I'm done being shot at.

306
00:12:23,179 --> 00:12:24,209
You understand that, right?

307
00:12:24,209 --> 00:12:25,585
G-MAN: It's time to choose.

308
00:12:25,585 --> 00:12:29,890
You're threatening me, you took my
weapons, and you're a fucking Time Lord.

309
00:12:29,890 --> 00:12:30,853
This is bullshit.

310
00:12:30,853 --> 00:12:33,347
[fzzt]

311
00:12:33,347 --> 00:12:38,882
G-MAN: Wisely done, Mr. Freeman!
I will see you up ahead.

312
00:12:50,603 --> 00:12:52,868
[Big thanks to Ross Scott for all
the great work! --danielsangeo]

313
00:17:05,739 --> 00:17:10,698
G-MAN: I can offer you a battle
you have no chance of winning.

314
00:17:10,698 --> 00:17:14,681
G-MAN: Rather an anticlimax
after what you've just survived.

315
00:17:14,681 --> 00:17:17,200
Hey, asshole! I don't work for you!

316
00:17:18,093 --> 00:17:18,801
Do you--

317
00:17:19,711 --> 00:17:21,355
G-MAN: Time to choose.

318
00:17:21,355 --> 00:17:23,211
You're not explaining anything,

319
00:17:23,211 --> 00:17:25,787
so, to me, that say you're just
going to fuck me,

320
00:17:25,787 --> 00:17:27,303
so why am I even talking to you?

321
00:17:27,303 --> 00:17:28,736
G-MAN: It's time to choose.

322
00:17:28,736 --> 00:17:32,850
Okay, here's what we're going to do:
you're going to turn this space tram around,

323
00:17:32,850 --> 00:17:34,973
drop me off back on Earth,

324
00:17:34,973 --> 00:17:38,226
then you can tell Langley your
personality didn't win me over.

325
00:17:38,226 --> 00:17:41,683
G-MAN: Well, it looks like we
won't be working together.

326
00:17:41,683 --> 00:17:42,258
Correct!

327
00:17:42,258 --> 00:17:44,340
G-MAN: No regrets, Mr. Freeman.

328
00:17:44,340 --> 00:17:45,000
What?

329
00:17:45,899 --> 00:17:47,027
No!

330
00:17:47,027 --> 00:17:48,379
Okay...

331
00:17:48,379 --> 00:17:49,081
Shit!

332
00:17:49,081 --> 00:17:50,534
Okay, this is not...

333
00:17:51,370 --> 00:17:52,226
No!

334
00:17:52,226 --> 00:17:53,110
Wuah!

335
00:17:53,110 --> 00:17:56,786
Okay! I changed my mind! I'll listen to
what you have to sa-AAAH!

336
00:17:56,786 --> 00:17:58,640
WHAT ARE YOU?!

337
00:17:58,640 --> 00:18:02,023
LIKE, I'M SORRY, ALL RIGHT?!
I'LL DO WHAT YOU WANT!

338
00:18:02,023 --> 00:18:03,336
[squeals]

339
00:18:03,336 --> 00:18:04,667
DON'T EAT ME!

